=== PARITY (web source reproduced end-to-end) ===
  - Data sources (web useTranslation only; fully controlled component): the parent props
    state / onExecute / onRequestDialog / onToggleFavorite / loading / lastStatus / isFavorite
    are bound through three P1/S8 seams — ToggleCommandDispatching (execute on/off-command +
    requestDialog, reporting ToggleCommandEvent started/succeeded/failed/offline),
    ToggleStateObserving (the bound live boolean, web state[def.stateField]), and
    ToggleCommandFavoriteToggling — so ToggleCommandTileModel owns isOn / loading / lastStatus /
    isFavorite as derived state. No I/O in the view.
  - isOn derivation (web `def.stateField && state ? Boolean(state[def.stateField]) : localToggle`):
    a bound command uses the live value once known; an unbound command (or one whose live state
    has not loaded) falls back to a local optimistic toggle. EXECUTED unit tests cover both.
  - handleClick routing (web): when ON -> flip local toggle off (unbound only) + execute
    def.commandOff (no params); when OFF + inputConfig -> onRequestDialog(def); else -> flip
    local toggle on (unbound only) + execute def.command with def.params. EXECUTED tests cover
    turn-on(+params) / turn-off(no params) / input-gated(dialog) / bound-no-local-mutation.
  - Composition (web clickable GlassPanel + ghost Star Button + status dot + Loader2/Icon/iconOff):
      • Tile     -> Button(.plain) + TSMaterial.panel glass; while ON takes the variant tone
                    (border 0.45 + 0.08 wash, web styles.panel border-neon-*/20 bg-neon-*/5);
                    dims to 0.5 while executing (web loading && opacity-50); whole tile activates.
      • Star     -> sibling overlay Button (independent tap = web e.stopPropagation()),
                    star.fill+warning when favorite else star+muted (web amber-300 / muted),
                    aria = web t('commands.toggleFavorite'); .isSelected trait.
      • Dot      -> top-trailing Circle, variant tone when ON else surface (web isOn ? styles.dot
                    : bg-surface-2); non-interactive, accessibilityHidden.
      • Icon box -> ProgressView while executing else Image(systemName: def.systemImage(isOn:))
                    (web Loader2 / Icon / iconOff); variant tone fill+symbol when ON else neutral
                    surface (web styles.icon vs bg-surface-2 text-muted).
      • Labels   -> command label (textPrimary) + ON/OFF power line (variant tone when ON else
                    muted, web styles.text) + status line (✓→checkmark/green, else exclamation/red)
                    + freshness chip.
  - States (ALL rendered; each has a #if DEBUG preview + a model/adapter unit test):
      off (resting icon+label+OFF, never blank) · on (bound live state, variant tone) ·
